# A2P Regulatory Intelligence MCP Server

Model Context Protocol server exposing global A2P SMS regulatory data and onboarding guidance for 190+ countries.

Part of the [arundas.me](https://arundas.me) portfolio — shares data with [A2P Atlas](https://arundas.me/a2p-atlas).

## Install

```bash
cd mcp/a2p-regulatory
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[mcp]"
```

## Run (stdio)

```bash
python -m a2p_regulatory.server
# or
a2p-regulatory-mcp
```

## Cursor configuration

Add to `~/.cursor/mcp.json` (use absolute paths):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "a2p-regulatory": {
      "command": "python3",
      "args": ["/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/portfolio/mcp/a2p-regulatory/a2p_regulatory/server.py"],
      "env": {
        "A2P_DATA_PATH": "/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/portfolio/mcp/a2p-regulatory/data/countries.json"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Tools

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `lookup_country` | Regulatory profile by ISO-2 or name |
| `search_countries` | Filter by channel support level |
| `list_registration_required` | Markets requiring sender registration |
| `get_onboarding_guidance` | Launch checklist for country + channel |
| `compare_countries` | Side-by-side market comparison |
| `get_dataset_overview` | Dataset statistics |

## Data

Country records are sourced from AWS End User Messaging SMS and Twilio alphanumeric support references. Regenerate with:

```bash
python3 scripts/generate-a2p-data.py
```

This writes to `src/a2p-atlas/data/`, `backend/data/`, and `mcp/a2p-regulatory/data/`.
